    {
      "id": "PR_kwDOKIsnqM8AAAABEvSKqQ",
      "title": "eth/072: Soneium Mainnet fee-vault recipient update (re-creation of eth/066 after U20)",
      "author": "Wazabie",
      "number": 1556,
      "body": "Adds `src/tasks/eth/072-soneium-fee-vault-recipient-update`: \r\n- re-creates the cancelled eth/066 (#1520) for **Soneium Mainnet** to rotate the recipient of all four L2 fee-vault predeploys (SequencerFeeVault, BaseFeeVault, L1FeeVault, OperatorFeeVault) to the Soneium Foundation Safe `0x34ffF1A1CB3C054E9eD1BbD36883B14A66E6C260` (confirmed by the Soneium Foundation on #1520) \r\n- lowers `minWithdrawalAmount` 10 ETH → 5 ETH on the three vaults that carry it. \r\n\r\nWithdrawal networks and the OperatorFeeVault's zero minimum are untouched.\r\n\r\n",
      "repository": "ethereum-optimism/superchain-ops",
      "createdAt": "2026-09-23T11:26:40Z",
      "mergedAt": "2026-09-23T12:41:55Z",
      "additions": 372,
      "deletions": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "PR_kwDOKIsnqM8AAAABEdhsJg",
      "title": "eth/072: Ink Mainnet SystemConfig gas limit 60M to 30M",
      "author": "Wazabie",
      "number": 1555,
      "body": "Adds `src/tasks/eth/072-gas-limit-ink`: sets the Ink Mainnet (chainId 57073) `SystemConfig` gas limit from 60,000,000 back to 30,000,000 with a single `SystemConfig.setGasLimit(uint64)` call on the `SystemConfigProxy` `0x62C0a111929fA32ceC2F76aDba54C16aFb6E8364`, executed directly by its owner, the Foundation Upgrade Safe `0x847B5c174615B1B7fDF770882256e2D3E95b9D92` (owner since eth/065). No other `SystemConfig` parameter changes.\n\nBuilt with the `SystemConfigGasLimit` template, the same one used for eth/055 (OP Mainnet) and sep/103 (Ink Sepolia); the template roots the task at `SystemConfigOwner`, resolved per chain from `SystemConfig.owner()`. Docs follow the eth/067 and eth/071 layout: signer-only README sections, facilitator steps and state changes in VALIDATION.md.\n\nInputs: 30,000,000 is Ink's genesis gas limit (`superchain/configs/mainnet/ink.toml`, `genesis.system_config.gasLimit`) and the value Ink Sepolia runs with; the live Mainnet value is 60,000,000 (read 2026-09-21). The task is sequenced after eth/071, which consumes one FUS nonce as an L1PAO child, so the FUS nonce is pinned to 71 (live 70 + 1). `just simulate-stack eth 072-gas-limit-ink` runs 071 then 072 and exits 0 on this branch, which is rebased on #1554 (the post-U20 registry game discovery fix; without it the stacked run reverts with `zero address for PermissionedDisputeGame` after 071 upgrades Ink).\n\nStatus is DRAFT, NOT READY TO SIGN pending review; the hashes are fixed by the nonce pin and do not depend on 071's execution date.\n\n---\n\n## For Task PRs\n\n**Task path**: `src/tasks/eth/072-gas-limit-ink`\n\n**Tenderly simulation link**: https://dashboard.tenderly.co/TENDERLY_USERNAME/TENDERLY_PROJECT/simulator/new?\n\n### Simulation Checklist\n\n> These boxes must be checked before your PR can be merged.\n\n- [ ] I have run a Tenderly simulation for this task\n- [x] I have reviewed and understand all state changes in the simulation\n- [x] I have verified that every state change reflects the **exact expected value** (e.g., if setting an `absolutePrestate`, confirm the precise `bytes32` hash matches expectations)\n- [x] All state changes match the expected behavior documented in `VALIDATION.md`\n- [x] I can explain every state diff to reviewers and signers\n\nThe state diff was reviewed from the forge simulation output (`just simulate` / `just simulate-stack`): slot `0x68` of the SystemConfig (`gasLimit` 60000000 to 30000000, packed scalars unchanged) and the FUS nonce 71 to 72. The Tenderly replay of the link above is still to be done before the first box is ticked.\n\n### Task Checklist\n\n- [x] `README.md` is complete with accurate task description\n- [x] `VALIDATION.md` documents expected state changes with correct domain/message hashes\n- [x] Task status is set appropriately\n- [x] All TODOs in generated files have been addressed\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n",
      "repository": "ethereum-optimism/superchain-ops",
      "createdAt": "2026-09-21T17:34:31Z",
      "mergedAt": "2026-09-23T17:10:24Z",
